## Remaining work

Request 3007 is closed for the body and header states described above.
`deleteAcl` and `listAcl` remain unimplemented. Broader Phase 18 settings,
input, error, control-flow, reverse-export, and platform reconciliation also
remains open. No Broker, Docker, or remote CI was used. Pre-existing Phase 19
worktree paths remain unstaged and outside this slice.
